  friendName: Hector
  friendDescription: 'This is Hector the sheep. People assume he is angry, aggressive
    and unsafe to be around, but Hector is wildly misunderstood, deep down he loves
    to garden and take care of plants. He hopes to cultivate a garden all his friends
    will enjoy!

    His gardening skills allow Hector to remove overgrown vegetation
    that stand in the way of Glorp and Friends!'
